lementation cleanly separates display from mutation: the TUI crate has zero references to `TankState` or `full_state()`. The `TankSnapshot` was extended with the necessary biology/chemistry/hardware fields so screens can render complete detail without bypassing the snapshot boundary. The action form system handles all 12 `PlayerAction` variants with appropriate field types (numeric, choice, toggle) and validates through the engine's own `validate()` before dispatching.\n\nThe phosphate dissolution path added to feed decomposition is a reasonable v1 heuristic that makes the overfeeding → algae nuisance causal chain actually work, aligning the model with spec intent.\n\n## Commit Message\nfeat(tui): add TUI MVP with five screens, scenario startup, save/load, and strengthen determinism + overfeeding acceptance tests","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"25802005-47b4-42a6-9ace-9ceabaa42d42","total_cost_usd":1.14039775,"usage":{"input_tokens":25,"cache_creation_input_tokens":70719,"cache_read_input_tokens":1131058,"output_tokens":5310,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":70719,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":25,"outputTokens":5310,"cacheReadInputTokens":1131058,"cacheCreationInputTokens":70719,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.14039775,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"470bdfdf-1df5-476a-99b1-2ba413db151a"}
